12. TENANT ISOLATION
============================================================

Every cloud account operation must be tenant scoped.

An operator from tenant A must never:

- create an account for tenant B
- read tenant B accounts
- modify tenant B accounts
- delete tenant B accounts

Use the existing operator authentication mechanism.

Do not trust tenant IDs supplied freely by the frontend if the
existing auth layer provides the tenant identity.

